00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,484
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,484 --> 00:00:12,096
When you derive the pendulum formula, always state the assumption: small amplitude, so that sine theta is approximately theta in radians.

3
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:14,375
Examiners give a mark for that line.

4
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:22,773
For large swings, the motion is still periodic, but it is no longer simple harmonic, and the real period is longer.

